# Runtime configuration for Because Of This Engine V7.1.
# Keep real credentials in the secret manager; never commit them.

# Edge TTS is the canonical online narration provider.
# No API key, cloud project or billing account is required.
# It fails closed when its voice catalog is unavailable.

# Google Drive OAuth is injected by GitHub Actions secrets:
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET
# GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN
